(2) One copy of a vicinity map at a scale of 1:600 showing the property in relation to the general area of the city in which it is located;
(3) One copy of a completed project data sheet;
(4) Six copies of a one-page schematic plat drawn clearly and accurately by a design professional at a scale appropriate for the nature of the project, to include:
